    {
      "id": "hackernews-2026-05-27-i-m-tired-of-talking-to-ai",
      "title": "I'm Tired of Talking to AI",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://orchidfiles.com/im-tired-of-ai-generated-answers/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48292224\nPoints: 1741\n# Comments: 839",
      "body": "I found GitHub repositories that were spreading malware. I asked AI what to do about it, but it gave me nothing useful. So I opened a discussion on GitHub. Someone replied. It was the exact same text the AI had given me. I called it out and the comment was deleted. Then another person replied. It was the same AI answer again.I worked as a developer at a company. I asked the business owner a question about a business task. He sent me a ChatGPT screenshot with the answer. I replied that it had nothing to do with my question and everything there was wrong. A minute later he sent me another ChatGPT screenshot. He didn’t even read the AI’s answer. He just took a screenshot and forwarded it to me.Recently someone messaged me on Reddit about my post. I replied. They wrote again, I replied again. After a few messages I realized I was talking to an AI agent.I’m tired of talking to AI.I want to talk to real people.But even when I talk to people, they forward my questions to AI and send me the AI’s answer.\nI also publish all new notes on Telegram and Bluesky.",
      "source": "Hacker News",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": "theorchid",
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-27T10:43:25.000Z",
      "imageUrl": null,
      "originalUrl": "https://orchidfiles.com/im-tired-of-ai-generated-answers/",
      "readTimeMinutes": 1,
      "language": "en"
    },
