      "id": "hackernews-2026-05-26-incident-with-actions-and-pages",
      "title": "Incident with Actions and Pages",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://www.githubstatus.com/incidents/gnftqj9htp0g\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48278090\nPoints: 19\n# Comments: 7",
      "body": "We have identified the cause of the authentication issues affecting GitHub Actions and are actively working on mitigation\nPosted May 26, 2026 - 12:37 UTC\nActions is experiencing degraded performance. We are continuing to investigate.\nPosted May 26, 2026 - 12:17 UTC\nWe are investigating authentication issues leading to failure in starting Actions runs and downloading actions. At this time the majority of Actions runs is impacted.\nPosted May 26, 2026 - 11:53 UTC\nActions is experiencing degraded availability. We are continuing to investigate.\nPosted May 26, 2026 - 11:19 UTC\nWe are investigating reports of degraded performance for Actions and Pages\nPosted May 26, 2026 - 10:57 UTC\nThis incident affects: Actions and Pages.",
      "source": "Hacker News",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": "hakube",
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-26T11:10:19.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://dka575ofm4ao0.cloudfront.net/pages-twitter_logos/original/36420/GitHub-Mark-120px-plus.png",
