      "id": "hackernews-2026-05-23-white-rabbit-sub-nanosecond-synchronization-for-large-distri",
      "title": "White Rabbit – sub-nanosecond synchronization for large distributed systems",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://ohwr.org/projects/white-rabbit/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48245916\nPoints: 130\n# Comments: 28",
      "body": "White Rabbit provides sub-nanosecond accuracy and picoseconds\nprecision of synchronization for large distributed systems. It also\nallows for deterministic and reliable data delivery.White Rabbit allows you to precision time-tag measured data and lets\nyou trigger data taking in large installations while at the same time\nusing the same network to transmit data.sub-nanosecond synchronizationconnecting thousands of nodestypical distances of 10 km between nodesEthernet-based gigabit rate reliable data transferfully open hardware, firmware and softwaremulti-vendor commercially produced\nWhite RabbitLatest NewsJob opportunity at CERN: FPGA developerFeb 9, 2026CERN is looking to recruit an FPGA and hardware designer to work on White Rabbit switch v4. The opening is in the frame of the CERN Experienced Graduates Opportunities.\nAnyone interested is very welcome to apply and if you have questions don’t hesitate to contact us!Job opportunity at CERN: FPGA developerMay 5, 2025CERN is looking to recruit an FPGA developer to work on the WR Technology and other exciting projects. The opening is in the frame of the CERN Experienced Graduates Opportunities.\nAnyone interested is very welcome to apply and if you have questions don’t hesitate to contact us!Job vacancy at CERN to work on White Rabbit and RFSep 25, 2024We have an open position at CERN to work for 2-3 years on the evolution of the eRTM board. It is a WR node whose jitter (integrated between 100Hz and 20MHz) is less than 100 femtoseconds, the most precise WR node I know of, originally designed by Mattia Rizzi and Tomasz Włostowski.",
      "source": "Hacker News",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": "michaelsbradley",
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-23T08:38:44.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://gitlab.com/ohwr/project/white-rabbit/-/wikis/uploads/48fce74397857b877007ae8de013c89b/wrNetwork2.jpg",
      "originalUrl": "https://ohwr.org/projects/white-rabbit/",
