      "id": "bbc-2026-05-21-vote-for-your-favourite-moment-from-52-years-of-football-foc",
      "title": "Vote for your favourite moment from 52 years of Football Focus",
      "summary": "Vote for which Football Focus moment you want to be shown again in the programme's final episode on Sunday.",
      "body": "It is the end of an era for Football Focus.The longest-running football magazine show in the world comes to an end this Sunday after 52 years.Launched in 1974, Football Focus has provided fans with interviews, analysis and stories from across the game every lunchtime before the weekend's fixtures begin.With the final show approaching, we have selected some of our favourite moments and are giving you the chance to vote for which one you'd like to see in the final episode.See the options below, and vote for your favourite at the bottom of this page.Watch the final Football Focus this Sunday from 12:00 BST on BBC One, BBC iPlayer and the BBC Sport website and app.",
